   "method": "Test",
   "purpose": "Verify that measured input current and power agree with the rating label at every rated mains voltage, record the real input power of each operating mode separately — heater only (HEAT), LEDs only (CURE without heating) and the whole machine working (heater at full output plus all four LED drivers) — and verify that inrush current does not open the 15 A time-lag inlet fuse or trip a typical installation circuit breaker.\n",
   "applicability": {
    "rule": "SINGLE",
    "unit": "UUT-01"
   },
   "sample_rationale": "Electrical safety is checked once, by hand, by the engineer on his safety-test bench, on one unit; the result is recorded as his approval.\n",
